  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Sexual Reproductive Health and Rights: Preparing, Responding 2025-2028 - IPPF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to improve access to life-saving sexual and reproductive health and rights services for affected populations&#xa0;through implementation of the Minimum Initial Service Package for reproductive health in crises. The overarching purpose aims to reduce sexual and reproductive health related mortality and morbidity, sexual&#xa0;&amp;amp; gender-based violence, HIV and STI transmission, and unintended pregnancies in Kiribati, Cook Islands and Tuvalu, if affected by a humanitarian disaster.</narrative>
  </description>
